stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Draft: organizer creates<br/>(title_i18n, problems, format)
    Draft --> Scheduled: publish<br/>(publish_at, ICS calendar entry)
    Scheduled --> Registration: start_at − window<br/>(reminders at T−24h/T−1h)
    Registration --> Running: start_at (contest_tick task)
    state Running {
        [*] --> Open
        Open --> Frozen: freeze_at (public board locks)
        Frozen --> Open: admin unfreeze (deliberate)
    }
    Running --> Judging: end_at<br/>submissions locked
    Judging --> Rated: ratings task computes Glicko<br/>(display_rating suppression < 5 contests)
    Judging --> Unrated: is_rated = false
    Rated --> Archived
    Unrated --> Archived
    Archived --> Upsolving: virtual participation +<br/>personal clock (CON-5),<br/>hacks unlock, editorials publish
    Upsolving --> [*]
